{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"dlang","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"D","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for D (.d .di).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"dlang","name":"D","extensions":[".d",".di"],"grammar":"grammars/dlang.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"D","path":"snippets/dlang.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/dlang.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\+\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\+\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`(?:[^`\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*`\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_]+\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:foreach_reverse|synchronized|deprecated|immutable|interface|invariant|protected|abstract|continue|delegate|function|override|template|unittest|default|finally|foreach|nothrow|package|private|version|assert|delete|export|extern|import|module|pragma|public|return|shared|static|struct|switch|typeid|typeof|alias|align|break|catch|class|const|debug|final|inout|macro|mixin|scope|super|throw|union|while|auto|body|case|cast|else|enum|goto|lazy|pure|this|with|asm|for|new|out|ref|try|do|if|in|is)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:ptrdiff_t|ushort|double|string|size_t|ubyte|short|ulong|float|wchar|dchar|void|bool|byte|uint|long|real|char|int)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:writefln|writeln|readln|format|write|to)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/dlang.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import std.stdio;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"void main() {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The main function\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:int} ${2:name}(${3:int x}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Unit test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ut\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"unittest {\",\n      \"\\tassert($0);\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A unittest\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# D\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for D.\n\n## Files\n\n`.d`, `.di`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `main` | The main function |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `ut` | A unittest |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}